  "limitations": [
    "Local checks ran on Windows; Linux awaits remote CI.",
    "The earlier 764-case checkpoint is committed as Hufu42a045b/Penghou77bac95/Zhinu a1df6e9. Telemetry source/docs remain local; no push or publication is performed.",
    "All six initial Hufu candidate packages remain unpublished; remote CI and user-controlled main publication remain gates.",
    "This instruments completed request-preflight observations only; broker effects, approval waits, measurable revocation propagation, authorized evidence correlation and outcome reconciliation remain separate gates.",
    "Closed action/outcome/timing data is lossy operational telemetry, not provenance, audit totals, authority or mandatory evidence receipts.",
    "One host-owned worker and finite queue isolate synchronous listener delays; permanently blocked listeners cannot be terminated and host-wide/process capacity remains host-owned.",
    "Dispose is nonblocking and stops acceptance/discards pending data; already executing emissions may complete afterwards and no flush/drain guarantee is supplied.",
    "The decorator invokes exactly once with the original request/token and returns/rethrows the exact inner outcome. It does not repair a malformed or permissive authorizer.",
    "Emission failures are ordinary synchronous instrumentation exceptions; host-selected listeners/exporters own their own redaction, access controls, credentials and data-release authorization.",
    "No engine/SDK/exporter dependency, protected correlation identifier, production host or mutation-start/revocation guarantee is added.",
    "Biscuit and frozen legacy adapters remain outside the initial six-package release."
  ],
